      "message": "Where does this come from? Are you trying to allocate space for the maximum number of capture types? If so, it should be a constant. Also, why the `sizeof(uint32_t)`? \n\nComparing to [this code](https://crrev.com/c/6354365):\n\n```\n\targs-\u003eresponse_size \u003d sizeof(struct ec_response_fp_info_v2) +\n\t\t\t      (r-\u003esensor_info.num_capture_types) *\n\t\t\t\t      sizeof(struct fp_image_frame_params);\n```",
